WEBVTT

00:01.622 --> 00:04.555
[groovy music]
[动听的音乐]

00:04.622 --> 00:11.855
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:14.355 --> 00:16.388
- [yawns]
- [哈欠]

00:22.922 --> 00:25.222
[puffs]
[泡芙]

00:26.388 --> 00:28.055
[smacks]
[咂嘴]

00:28.122 --> 00:31.255
[western music]
[西方音乐]

00:31.322 --> 00:35.622
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:35.688 --> 00:37.588
[exhales sharply]
[急促地呼气]

00:38.622 --> 00:40.122
[groans]
[呻吟]

00:43.988 --> 00:46.155
Oops.
Doink.
哎呀。
多因克。

00:46.222 --> 00:47.422
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

00:53.355 --> 00:55.455
I don't remember
leaving the fridge open.
我不记得了
让冰箱保持打开状态。

00:55.522 --> 00:57.922
Huh?
啊？

00:59.022 --> 01:03.188
Huh, I don't remember
making such a mess.
呃，我不记得了
弄得这么乱。

01:03.255 --> 01:06.288
And I'm pretty sure
I didn't eat spaghetti.
我很确定
我没有吃意大利面。

01:06.355 --> 01:09.455
Nope.
没有。

01:09.522 --> 01:10.455
[clatters]
Huh?
[咔哒声]
啊？

01:10.522 --> 01:11.888
[glass shattering]
[玻璃破碎]

01:11.955 --> 01:13.522
[clanging]
[叮叮当当]

01:13.588 --> 01:16.222
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

01:16.288 --> 01:19.522
- [loud moaning]
- [whimpers]
- [大声呻吟]
- [呜咽]

01:26.122 --> 01:28.355
Oh, hey, Patrick.
- [grunts]
哦，嘿，帕特里克。
- [咕哝]

01:29.422 --> 01:32.055
[yawns]
- Wake up, Patrick!
[哈欠]
- 醒来，帕特里克！

01:32.888 --> 01:36.055
[strained]
Whoa!
[紧张]
哇！

01:36.122 --> 01:38.388
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

01:38.455 --> 01:41.488
[clanging]
[叮叮当当]

01:45.522 --> 01:47.288
[clanging continues]
- [snoring continues]
[叮当声继续]
- [鼾声继续]

01:47.355 --> 01:49.155
[air horn blows]
[气喇叭吹响]

01:50.455 --> 01:52.488
- [strains]
- [菌株]

01:52.555 --> 01:54.122
Whoa!
哇！

01:59.955 --> 02:03.188
[horn bellows]
[喇叭声]

02:04.855 --> 02:07.455
[car alarms blaring]
[dogs barking]
[汽车警报器响亮]
[狗吠]

02:08.888 --> 02:12.122
- [mumbles]
- [咕哝]

02:14.022 --> 02:17.255
[snoring]
[打鼾]

02:28.655 --> 02:31.688
Aah!
[groaning]
啊啊！
[呻吟]

02:33.255 --> 02:36.488
[snoring, groaning]
[打鼾、呻吟]

02:44.622 --> 02:46.622
[horns honking]
[喇叭鸣响]

02:46.688 --> 02:50.555
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

02:50.622 --> 02:52.922
[tires screeching]
- [panting]
[轮胎的尖叫声]
- [气喘吁吁]

02:52.988 --> 02:56.188
Aah!
[grunting]
啊啊！
[咕噜声]

03:17.422 --> 03:18.522
[shutters]
[百叶窗]

03:18.588 --> 03:22.588
Aah!
Whew.
啊啊！
呼。

03:22.655 --> 03:24.322
[exclaims]
- [moans]
[惊呼]
- [呻吟]

03:24.388 --> 03:26.255
[clatters]
- [grunts]
[咔哒声]
- [咕哝]

03:26.322 --> 03:28.155
- [yawning]
[vase shatters]
- [打哈欠]
[花瓶碎裂]

03:28.222 --> 03:31.455
- [indistinct shouting]
- [隐隐约约的喊叫]

03:35.488 --> 03:37.755
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:37.822 --> 03:39.388
- [indistinct shouting]
- [隐隐约约的喊叫]

03:39.455 --> 03:42.022
- Shh! Shhh!
- 嘘！嘘！

03:42.088 --> 03:46.055
- [groans, sighs]
- [呻吟，叹息]

03:47.255 --> 03:49.655
- Uh-huh.
Phew.
- 呃哈。
唷。

03:49.722 --> 03:50.888
- What the--?
- 什么--？

03:50.955 --> 03:53.922
- Aah!
[grunts]
- 啊啊！
[咕哝]

03:53.988 --> 03:57.655
Ooh!
Ow!
哦！
噢！

03:59.622 --> 04:00.822
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

04:00.888 --> 04:02.888
[yawns]
[哈欠]

04:02.955 --> 04:04.622
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

04:04.688 --> 04:07.522
Blech!
Ow!
布莱赫！
噢！

04:07.588 --> 04:08.755
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:08.822 --> 04:12.055
- [groaning, snoring]
- [呻吟，打鼾]

04:16.688 --> 04:19.222
Mm.
Ahh...
毫米。
啊...

04:19.288 --> 04:20.922
- No, Patrick, no!
- 不，帕特里克，不！

04:20.988 --> 04:24.288
Don't!
[both grunting]
不！
[两人都咕哝着]

04:25.488 --> 04:27.355
- [laughs]
- [笑]

04:31.822 --> 04:34.822
[shutters]
[百叶窗]

04:40.822 --> 04:42.555
Huh?
Aah!
啊？
啊啊！

04:45.255 --> 04:48.188
[classical music]
[古典音乐]

04:48.255 --> 04:55.488
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:58.522 --> 05:00.822
Ohh!
哦！

05:03.122 --> 05:06.055
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

05:06.122 --> 05:09.055
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:09.122 --> 05:10.922
- [whistles]
- [口哨]

05:10.988 --> 05:14.255
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

05:14.322 --> 05:17.055
Whoa!
哇！

05:17.122 --> 05:21.222
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:21.288 --> 05:24.188
- Breezy.
[grunts]
- 轻松。
[咕哝]

05:24.255 --> 05:27.555
- [grunts, strains]
- [咕哝声，紧张]

05:33.622 --> 05:36.688
[screaming]
[尖叫]

05:38.888 --> 05:41.155
- [yawning]
- [打哈欠]

05:41.222 --> 05:45.488
[snoring]
- [groans]
[打鼾]
- [呻吟]

05:45.555 --> 05:48.588
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

05:51.555 --> 05:53.555
- Ow!
- 噢！

05:53.622 --> 05:57.488
[exclaims]
- Oh, brother.
[惊呼]
- 哦，兄弟。

05:57.555 --> 06:00.022
[snoring]
- [exclaiming continues]
[打鼾]
- [惊呼继续]

06:00.088 --> 06:01.022
Oh!
哦！

06:01.088 --> 06:03.688
[traffic noises]
[交通噪音]

06:03.822 --> 06:06.188
Oh, he'll be fine.
哦，他会没事的。

06:08.688 --> 06:09.655
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

06:09.722 --> 06:11.655
[crashes]
[崩溃]

06:11.722 --> 06:12.355
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

[轮胎的尖叫声]